     <P style="WIDOWS: 2; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 'Microsoft YaHei'; WHITE-SPACE: normal; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: medium; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; WORD-SPACING: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial"><STRONG><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">编者按：</SPAN></STRONG></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; WIDOWS: 2; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 32px; FONT-FAMILY: 'Microsoft YaHei'; WHITE-SPACE: normal; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: medium; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; WORD-SPACING: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">鲁家贤先生是绍兴一中</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">1956</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">届校友，著名乡贤、爱乡楷模。从</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">1987</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">年起，鲁先生就在母校设立了</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">鲁家贤奖学金</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">，用于每年奖励品学兼优的学生。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">2019</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">年，鲁先生及其子高央先生又出资</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">3000</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">万元（分</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">5</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">年实施）设立</SPAN><STRONG><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">“</SPAN></SPAN></STRONG><STRONG><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">绍兴一中英贤计划</SPAN></STRONG><STRONG><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">”</SPAN></SPAN></STRONG><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">项目，用于支持母校引进高层次人才、奖励教学业绩优秀的教师团队和高考、竞赛成绩优异的学生，助力母校更好、更优、更有特色发展。其中，</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">英贤学生奖</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">专门奖励每年在高考与竞赛中成绩优异的学生。</SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; WIDOWS: 2; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 32px; FONT-FAMILY: 'Microsoft YaHei'; WHITE-SPACE: normal; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: medium; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; WORD-SPACING: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">2019</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">年度</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">英贤学生奖</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">已经颁发。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">2019</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">届一大批考取一流大学的高三毕业生获此殊荣。拿到沉甸甸的奖金（</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">名校录取</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">分</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">2000</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">元</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">/</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">人、</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">4000</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">元</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">/</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">人两档，</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">竞赛获奖</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">分</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">10000</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">元</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">/</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">人、</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">20000</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">元</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">/</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">人两档），已经在各大著名高校深造的一中学子们纷纷<STRONG>表达了对母校老师、对鲁家贤学长的诚挚感谢和美好祝愿</STRONG>。<STRONG>他们在感言中，诉说一中情怀，分享大学体验，描绘青春梦想，对一中的学弟学妹们很有启发意义。</STRONG></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; WIDOWS: 2; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 32px; FONT-FAMILY: 'Microsoft YaHei'; WHITE-SPACE: normal; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: medium; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; WORD-SPACING: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">我们分批为大家奉上这些获奖者的感言，<STRONG>既彰英贤，又启来者</STRONG>。</SPAN></P><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202004/2020042909105398.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2019</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">届高三</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>16</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">班</SPAN><FONT face=Calibri> <SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </SPAN></FONT></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">杜心怡</SPAN><FONT face=Calibri> <SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </SPAN></FONT></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">复旦大学</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">很荣幸能获得英贤奖学金，感谢鲁家贤先生对母校的支持与关心！要是没有母校的悉心栽培，就没有今天的我！</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在一中的三年无疑是我人生中一段宝贵的旅程。在这里有亦师亦友的老师们，有团结友爱的同学们，有兼容并包的氛围，有求真博雅的精神。感谢老师与同学们一路以来的帮助与关心！</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">最后，祝学弟学妹们在高考中都能取得满意的成绩！大鹏一日同风起，愿高考后一夏天的风都属于你们！祝母校越办越好！</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202004/2020042909110335.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2019</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">届高三</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>10</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">班</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">俞鸿飞</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">浙江大学</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">获得“英贤学生奖”，深感荣幸，最开心的莫过于自己在高中阶段的付出得到了肯定。感谢鲁家贤先生，感谢母校老师们的栽培。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">从踏入无数卓越前辈们留下印记的一中校园，到步入大学校园有机会实现自己的未来，一中的博雅教育构建起了我成长的最坚实桥梁。我将一直铭记、感恩母校、老师对我的关心与帮助。今后仍不忘初心，继续奋斗。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202004/2020042909111763.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2019</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">届高三</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>14</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">班</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">祝涵瑜</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">浙江大学</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">很荣幸能获得英贤奖学金，感谢鲁家贤先生对我们的关心和支持，感谢母校对我们的肯定及鼓励。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在寻梦的旅程中，奋斗是不变的真理。天道酬勤，恒者能胜，我将始终带着这份期许，在未来的学习生活中继续前进！</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202004/2020042909112808.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2019</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">届高三</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>15</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">班</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">金裕杰</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">浙江大学</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">能够获得母校设立的“英贤学生奖”，我倍感荣幸与感激。感谢鲁家贤先生对一中后学晚辈的关怀。这个奖项的获得，一方面是我们努力学习的结果，另一方面也离不开学校和老师对我们的培养与付出。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">一个阶段的结束，意味着另一个新阶段的开始。此次获奖给我的高中生涯画上了一个圆满的句号。面对接下来的挑战，我必将继续努力，鞭策自我，以更加优异的成绩来回报母校。今日的我以母校为荣，希望有朝一日我也能为母校的荣光作出自己的一份贡献。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202004/2020042909113926.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2019</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">届高三</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>15</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">班</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">缪之恺</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">浙江大学</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">我很荣幸能获得绍兴一中的英贤奖学金，感谢鲁家贤先生对一中学子的关心。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">回忆高中生活，我想特别感谢老师们，他们的耐心与信任让我能以自己的节奏学习，使我的高三生活没有过度的压力，只有充实与展望。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">我也特别感谢母校多元化的教育环境，让我培养了许多兴趣爱好，拓宽了自己的眼界。希望我在将来能成为母校的骄傲。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">祝学弟学妹中在高考中取得理想的成绩，也祝绍兴一中继续创造辉煌。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
